---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Realtime Voice AI | AI Platform Engineer"
  description="MCP + Realtime GPT for voice-driven customer support and low-latency dialogue."
>
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="page-header-inner">
      <h1>Realtime Voice AI</h1>
      <p>MCP + Realtime GPT for voice-driven customer support</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section style="padding-top: 2rem;">
    <div class="proj-section">
      <h2>Business problem</h2>
      <p>Customer support and live assistance benefit from voice-first, low-latency AI that can call tools and access context in real time. This project delivers a voice AI stack that combines Realtime API with MCP for tool use and extensibility.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="proj-section">
      <h2>Architecture</h2>
      <p>Voice input → Realtime GPT (streaming) with MCP tool layer for knowledge lookup, APIs, and workflows. Responses are streamed back as audio for natural conversation with minimal perceived latency.</p>
      <div class="diagram-placeholder">
        [Architecture: Voice In → Realtime GPT (streaming) ↔ MCP (Tools / Knowledge) → Voice Out]
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="proj-section">
      <h2>Technical highlight</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Realtime GPT integration for streaming voice dialogue</li>
        <li>Model Context Protocol (MCP) for tool and data access</li>
        <li>Low-latency pipeline for customer support scenarios</li>
        <li>Streaming response and audio playback</li>
        <li>Extensible tool set for future use cases</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="proj-section">
      <h2>Metrics & impact</h2>
      <div class="proj-metrics">
        <span>Realtime GPT</span>
        <span>MCP</span>
        <span>Customer support</span>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">Enables voice-driven customer support with tool-augmented, real-time responses.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="cta-block">
    <a href="/#showcase" class="btn btn-secondary">← All projects</a>
    <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-left: 0.5rem;">Contact</a>
  </div>

  <footer class="footer">
    <p>AI Platform & Agentic AI Engineer</p>
  </footer>
</Layout>
